"Action" = "Action";
"Add Audifern from the desktop widget gallery. On macOS 26 or later, add its controls through Edit Controls in Control Center and place supported controls in the menu bar. Widget buttons need Audifern running with current device values. macOS manages sizes and placement. Sliders are available in Audifern’s panel; system controls use supported buttons and toggles." = "Add Audifern from the desktop widget gallery. On macOS 26 or later, add its controls through Edit Controls in Control Center and place supported controls in the menu bar. Widget buttons need Audifern running with current device values. macOS manages sizes and placement. Sliders are available in Audifern’s panel; system controls use supported buttons and toggles.";
