"Audifern Help" = "Audifern Help";
"Audifern has no account or telemetry service. Audiograms, local presets and caches stay on this Mac. Widgets receive only the state needed for their controls, without serial numbers or raw Bluetooth identifiers. Exports and external links require an explicit action." = "Audifern has no account or telemetry service. Audiograms, local presets and caches stay on this Mac. Widgets receive only the state needed for their controls, without serial numbers or raw Bluetooth identifiers. Exports and external links require an explicit action.";
"Audifern quick control" = "Audifern quick control";
"Audifern reads available runtime telemetry after connecting when a compatible local credential is provisioned. It caches the timestamped reading, counts down locally and refreshes about hourly while connected. Runtime comes from reported charge and current draw, never a percentage conversion. Charging stops the countdown. Cached estimates expire after two hours; hover over the estimate to see its reading time." = "Audifern reads available runtime telemetry after connecting when a compatible local credential is provisioned. It caches the timestamped reading, counts down locally and refreshes about hourly while connected. Runtime comes from reported charge and current draw, never a percentage conversion. Charging stops the countdown. Cached estimates expire after two hours; hover over the estimate to see its reading time.";
